    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddea Become a Slime Scientist</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is your own lab where all the slime-making happens. You\u2019ve got everything you need to mix, stretch, and get creative\u2014powered by a real-time fluid simulation system. Combine ingredients to create your own slime from scratch. Experiment to find your favorite formula!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683570/extras/2b5f2e807eb77a5746b81c78efa2c205.poster.avif?t=1754382222\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683570/extras/2b5f2e807eb77a5746b81c78efa2c205.webm?t=1754382222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683570/extras/2b5f2e807eb77a5746b81c78efa2c205.mp4?t=1754382222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfa8 Customize Your Slime</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are endless combinations!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play around with tons of colors</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add charms, glow effects, and tweak the stickiness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Melt it down or freeze it into a new shape</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whatever theme you're feeling\u2014cozy, creepy, colorful\u2014you've got the charms to match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683570/extras/6365376b331f478a3aa94be506e45cee.poster.avif?t=1754382222\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683570/extras/6365376b331f478a3aa94be506e45cee.webm?t=1754382222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683570/extras/6365376b331f478a3aa94be506e45cee.mp4?t=1754382222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddfe Fulfill Customer Orders</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're not just creating for fun\u2014customers are counting on you! Match their orders as best you can, and see how your creations measure up.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udce6 Run the Lab</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your lab stocked and running. Order supplies, upgrade your tools, and unlock new ingredients. The better your setup, the more you can create.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddea Become a Slime Scientist</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is your own lab where all the slime-making happens. You\u2019ve got everything you need to mix, stretch, and get creative\u2014powered by a real-time fluid simulation system. Combine ingredients to create your own slime from scratch. Experiment to find your favorite formula!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683570/extras/2b5f2e807eb77a5746b81c78efa2c205.poster.avif?t=1754382222\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683570/extras/2b5f2e807eb77a5746b81c78efa2c205.webm?t=1754382222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683570/extras/2b5f2e807eb77a5746b81c78efa2c205.mp4?t=1754382222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfa8 Customize Your Slime</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are endless combinations!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play around with tons of colors</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add charms, glow effects, and tweak the stickiness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Melt it down or freeze it into a new shape</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whatever theme you're feeling\u2014cozy, creepy, colorful\u2014you've got the charms to match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683570/extras/6365376b331f478a3aa94be506e45cee.poster.avif?t=1754382222\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683570/extras/6365376b331f478a3aa94be506e45cee.webm?t=1754382222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683570/extras/6365376b331f478a3aa94be506e45cee.mp4?t=1754382222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddfe Fulfill Customer Orders</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're not just creating for fun\u2014customers are counting on you! Match their orders as best you can, and see how your creations measure up.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udce6 Run the Lab</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your lab stocked and running. Order supplies, upgrade your tools, and unlock new ingredients. The better your setup, the more you can create.</p>",
    "short_description": "Become a slime scientist in a playful VR sandbox and get hands-on with the most satisfying slimes! Experiment with fluid physics to create endless combinations using unique colors and charms\u2014for yourself or your next customer.",
